---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { displayDate } from '../../lib/format';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy policy – French notary fees calculator" description="What data this site processes, on what basis, for how long, and how to exercise your rights. The calculator sends nothing you enter and the site does not measure its audience." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This page describes the processing of personal data linked to the use of {SITE_URL}, in accordance with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR) and French Law no. 78-17 of 6 January 1978.</p>
    <h2>Data controller</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <h2>What the calculator does not do</h2>
    <p>The calculation runs in your browser. Price, département, situation and options are not sent to any server and are not stored anywhere. The share link encodes your inputs in the page address: only send it to people of your choice.</p>
    <h2>Processing carried out</h2>
    <p><strong>Connection logs.</strong> The host records the IP address, date, page requested and browser, for the security and diagnosis of the service (legitimate interest, art. 6-1 f GDPR), under its own retention policy.</p>
    <p><strong>Audience measurement and advertising.</strong> The site does not measure its audience and displays no advertising as of the update date of this page. If this changes, this page and the cookies page will be updated before anything is activated, and you will be offered a choice.</p>
    <p><strong>Messages.</strong> If you write to the contact address, your address and message are processed to reply to you and kept for at most three years after the last exchange.</p>
    <h2>Recipients and transfers</h2>
    <p>No data is sold or transferred. The host, GitHub (United States), acts as processor; transfers are covered by the European Commission’s standard contractual clauses and the EU–US Data Privacy Framework.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection, portability: write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>, reply within one month. You may complain to the {LEGAL.supervisoryAuthority}: <a href={LEGAL.supervisoryAuthorityUrl} rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">{LEGAL.supervisoryAuthorityUrl}</a>. Last updated: {displayDate(LAST_UPDATED, 'en-GB')}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
